### Get products with Estonian authorizations (Non-CAPs)
GET {{$dotenv PMS_BASE_URL}}/MedicinalProductDefinition
    ?_has%3ARegulatedAuthorization%3Asubject%3Aregion=100000000388
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv PMS_API_TOKEN}}

### Get products for package with MA number 747511
GET {{$dotenv PMS_BASE_URL}}/MedicinalProductDefinition
    ?_has%3APackagedProductDefinition%3Apackage-for%3A_has%3ARegulatedAuthorization%3Asubject%3Aidentifier=747511
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv PMS_API_TOKEN}}

### Get all details of product with MA number 747511
GET {{$dotenv PMS_BASE_URL}}/MedicinalProductDefinition/600001688082/$everything
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv PMS_API_TOKEN}}
